    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// A bundle of facts that must travel together is a record; a value of it is" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// what a `structure` was; a function over it is what a `template structure`" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// was. The one thing this gives that a bag of parameters does not is that the" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// facts travel *together*: a key, its collection, and how the two spell a" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// degree are useless apart, and passing them one at a time is how they drift" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// (docs/rules/language/01-surface.md §1.2)." },
